            "zaxbys": "Zaxby's SPE Franchisor LLC, doing business as Zaxbys, is an American chain of fast casual restaurants offering chicken fingers, sandwiches, chicken wings, appetizers, and salads. The chain operates primarily in the Southern United States and has more than 900 locations.",
