            "shame": "Shame is an unpleasant self-conscious emotion associated with negative self-evaluation in relation to social norms and one’s personal moral standards.",
            "sorrow": "Castlevania: Dawn of Sorrow is a 2005 action role-playing game developed and published by Konami. It is part of Konami's Castlevania video game series and the first Castlevania game released on the Nintendo DS.",
            "stress": "In psychology, stress is a feeling of emotional strain and pressure. Stress is a form of psychological and mental discomfort.",
            "stressed": "Stressed: suffering stress (either physical or mental).",
            "suffering": "Suffering: experiencing pain; characterized by suffering.",
            "tears": "Crocodile tears, or superficial sympathy, is a colloquial term used to describe a false, insincere display of emotion, such as a hypocrite crying fake tears of grief.",
            "tired": "Tired: fed up, annoyed, irritated, sick of.",
            "traumatized": "Traumatized: having been subjected to psychological trauma.",
            "uneasy": "Uneasy: restless; disturbed by pain, anxiety.",
            "vulnerable": "Vulnerable: open to disclosing one's inner thoughts and feelings, acting in spite of one's instinct to self-preservation.",
